index 87a4a2b9497..0127c75303b 100644
--- a/public/lib/UPGRADING.md
+++ b/public/lib/UPGRADING.md
@@ -4,6 +4,11 @@
 
 ### Added
 
+- A new ad-hoc task `\core\task\delete_block_instances_task` has been added. It deletes all the instances (and related data) of a given block plugin in the background, and can be created with `\core\task\delete_block_instances_task::instance($blockname)`.
+
+  When a block plugin whose code is no longer present on disk is uninstalled (for example when a block is removed from core and uninstalled during an upgrade), `\core\plugininfo\block::uninstall_cleanup()` now queues this task to delete the block instances after the upgrade has completed instead of deleting them synchronously.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89289](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89289)
 - `email_to_user()` now emits a hook `before_email_to_user`. This hook allows any subscriber to modify the email contents, add additional headers, or add reasons to block the email. If any block reasons are added, the email is stopped from being sent and the reasons are output.
 
   For more information see [MDL-69724](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-69724)
